  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eed1c66b2c567fad7a1d055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇等等～，怎么了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fdc34319e8122908d4a0918392c984c671f785e3473ef69f22ad0966d9e737b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9333fd0e372d94ee9ec74aef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务在这里哦♪\n要完成哦～。\n诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "304f400868e8ad08bf4dbcae267913281e869d9ef147f9feedb45505c28efeda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2fe33353addaa22548a789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务，幸苦啦～！\n今天想好好地\n泡个澡…叭叭叭～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce158ef47c2df2d15a5017b4f8f340d9d8f7e889a920203c5f7b823cb8ded83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ab5d39bf3f66032d77eb7dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbd67612cd66b4db85fe8a412ad9ac056de5ed4baa80e7807935d4b5da24997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7dfb3793ff327adfda3982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回应吧啊啊～～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8db4aee1d67abcfa31fd6194498c6b24931a2d111328e085d157ce6bf1f10aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6466bc4c88577ffb2a90eaff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回应大家的声援吧啊啊～～！？\r\n……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b91a757358261e7cb1e4bb0e629031934ac3215d355088feff44bdab6d91d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:283154a193f30bc7207247c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铛铛铛的hohohoyー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "678321e23be7868d12d17e3d0857324669887a5c824bd9da289de8e6f622ff58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec785ac170521ce15e4c900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，传达到了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bd11ed36183b489f15b9a9bfa28ff80f3ddadf4aea22420bf15006e36595482",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c840b3c8b2ea4df5411d7f86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油咯ー！诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1cc1f40496f5cf26d7306d3cb08a6ce97a596a944a679d8d4bb49779f54101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737a6f5661de65eafd6b387d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员经常把各种各样的东西\n都平分呢～。机会难得，\n把回忆也平分…什么的～嘻嘻",
      "source_fingerprint": "56d06b6144606690a460970e99c57d3618834c1a6f7200b46fe3d881cca2eba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec159ef7e7655266b93171c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服的颜色也好，款式也好，\n和我的帽子都是最～佳搭配对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0e4cdb9e0e64feed2718238db6f9f21f20324e5b2cc8fd275876d5226d6d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9dc10acde2f27b55637411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒哒铛♪\n穿上这个就变得很想跳舞了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a3b3e0aee394cbb4a946b6e0c5d880412fc035470cfce2c0cab1c241ae26e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b682736657f964ac7a64da3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己的特别决胜服…\n这样一来，“叭叭”地向瞄准第一～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b33ea05f47264e8b0c8ab822fe3578a0e4662f8a34ef951995fde7e424518d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c453c4cb251a132a0986483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，很可爱吧。\n怎么样，合适吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "241bc54f9fd160c2a00ef0e9f3f64fe805e72fbc0023ad5b9e438bc744fb1fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804dcad7effca923f422d028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果在舞台上失败了，\n就会在不好的意义上引人注目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc83de707ef4f5c125e9c2d856466429af8f2b7e67c9c493c45483f170c3b03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a825b222780573af5aa0cff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这件衣服的我，\n能被大家记住就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b254fa30e1ecbd5cb86444f48b76e455b331998c2a284a1a1b126048504269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a81b4e10c2d39a19a8bf8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是蓝色版诗歌剧！\r\n宛如蓝色火焰熊熊燃烧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf980965482c807bd6ceba0c5ec53507f13043ba0c7ca6ab92147b1081e11ec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed07d19d16496afd63228696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赢、要赢、要赢哦──！\r\n请帮我加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7590896c35626bf5a9b1d9344e6188d286e26f9e7f66fe84900e61c24c409857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca800bf21aa91872aae09ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵ー，怎么样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ea66df4d96676feeb255b85c5bfb466927db0f6bad9d571025487e163b1eee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff765f606de2884ed8dab28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服，很有气势呢。\n呣呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b7a6d4bf2423d253a7f64054988d5a84ef1091cf4d567abdabe0582d90affa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dafb0a59c57bcf72a12e158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んーっ！やっぱり自分で\r\n選んだ服は落ち着きますっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4674267c307a12cae7f1e7f560ce3e76d581aa23a0ae3d206e5815a50ca0c3ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ba3a61b926c6a76256e75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゆるめで動きやすい服、ってなると、大体\r\n同じようなお洋服になっちゃうんですよねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "038ad0a87385e3cce44defafce3ad8cac0fcc6cb83e7f69ae48e4c6ee57d0ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be3209695ca7a807bc86d99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服的颜色也好，款式也好，\n和我的帽子都是最～佳搭配对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0e4cdb9e0e64feed2718238db6f9f21f20324e5b2cc8fd275876d5226d6d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f750bccf8c63643e4ea8da52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒哒铛♪\n穿上这个就变得很想跳舞了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a3b3e0aee394cbb4a946b6e0c5d880412fc035470cfce2c0cab1c241ae26e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
