      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a1252df0c1e0a701463a50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是蓝色版诗歌剧！\r\n宛如蓝色火焰熊熊燃烧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf980965482c807bd6ceba0c5ec53507f13043ba0c7ca6ab92147b1081e11ec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27f3c21033db163f101c074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赢、要赢、要赢哦──！\r\n请帮我加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7590896c35626bf5a9b1d9344e6188d286e26f9e7f66fe84900e61c24c409857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88920dc0cf678d2ad88de5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵ー，怎么样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ea66df4d96676feeb255b85c5bfb466927db0f6bad9d571025487e163b1eee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a346ffe56adbbf5e3a421b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服，很有气势呢。\n呣呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b7a6d4bf2423d253a7f64054988d5a84ef1091cf4d567abdabe0582d90affa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3d8e5a22e2b959bcd7afa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e040843cc98ab6899b5c60a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上ー好！\n今天一天也“咚咔”地\n加油吧～！呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0683b26876b7801f89a78d1cc5c3ac21b728c712a35b209519a86b5a72a8b0b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f551751784bbf586ed6afffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐，你猜猜我吃了什么？\n提示就是，软趴趴～\n黏乎黏乎黏乎乎～的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02d4b3a741ad37c7a63bf7c96e6c507d640e5bed8a346829836621b92b573f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d94715a258b2b71122556c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时间，真想\n要多一小时啊～。这样的话，\n就有时间睡午觉了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ed0478aab64899a12438161716e44c02ee56a907a8d6a0c7d569b67f71d544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f069472f47c1107f2fa2c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭，午饭，午饭饭～！\n午饭不好好吃的话，\n下午就会懒散散的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c3ed41df22c645d909afda90ba78b6263bb8b15e4dcfcb2fdbb9294b95c919",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e79e8f3dc1dccab3a97e65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早点上床，入睡。\n这样的话明早就能“邦邦”地\n元气满满地起床了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b4189439439a83ce1df532eef62c2258c00b282b08a0eaaec0bfcef1f10b782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9b7b02ebefde3d65b39276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做作业，复习今天一天所学，\n还有明天的预习和准备…\n还有什么要做的事吗～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32d2d76e6ae547faafbe80c8f530f068bea5a2d9f0585a486833e27e78d815a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a42bcd1c56b33225262e8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被新生们称呼的话，\n诗歌剧前辈和待兼前辈…\n哪个更好呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "459086b3cdce609a4f66a28b9d4f00708580e42de935ae4d32483baaf0fd59fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2139f8df4be058b32f0064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天不是很“咕哦”的吗？\n西瓜，烟花，还有祭典…看，\n有好多快乐的事，咕哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8addf38f6be2071df97e4b8ad22c2ad1ac527e2c796e63de2ef0e08db12ae5c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7fa01a821b4b12a3a7f1a39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚，炭烧红薯的车…！\n咕呜，用跑的话\n赶得上吗…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcff7d3787478a5c1069dfeffe671788656228f46ef1879b8009d2937368341b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b34df1ed486264d50cb18796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在雪地上跑的时候要注意点！\n非常的滑…那里已经\n滑溜溜地咻的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11fd85606617e161c3980261f80e05698bf39779b1c1c2f823b9791fa3589996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec312800d2ef4e40177be4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天从早上开始就超开心！\r\n想必会迎来非常快乐的一天～！\r\n……耶嘿，希望能成真！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21900dbd3db3fa4f9963cb3ec5a6bf50cf0b4e94eabb6dfad0c9d5e4fe3f1309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba4036694e62d34d5ed74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上练跑时遇到了理事长！\r\n她还让我摸她的猫咪，毛茸茸的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9c1b5e20c33b6e6bfbdbb9c2d13f82bcc2f478dbbec71c5367b9b920912209c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2811ecdd0583f2b38cef64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时玩了躲避球！\r\n我应该变得更会接球了吧？\r\n还在场上留到最后哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "447ae47576128ff040473cccdb121043f314eae5eb802d2c3b7b42be280739ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77b82c0ded7e89c1b6522dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的点心\r\n是粉丝送我的苹果！\r\n切成兔子形状再吃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b9cf2cbeedafe61c2d83da55c9c815e11bcd2291b11666c804cd77c5428721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50677957172dcb3d321fbe5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "傍晚逛商店街的时候啊，\r\n有人对我说「加油～！」呢！\r\n耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0adb982bf96b3cbf87c9dd866c0fb199f88c04bf40da47fd27ad56b55b8fb7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ee90c57c4eceeb50e1e98c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪避！接住！然后传球！\r\n闪避！接住！然后传球！\r\n很好，今天复习完毕～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb60236057de482969d843d5cb032dc8c645b58e5ea6d66a951b6d56da960541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da7ee392de547718c3d1065",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢春季粉丝大感谢祭，\r\n因为可以和大家一起喊\r\n加油、加油、姆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "892ed5bab35174f6d576f80a95498ef394796db5ef9b8da8002710756a6c3ca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2475a1f5ae3285501c7386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连肚脐都露出来了，好凉快啊～！\r\n可不可以用来代替运动服……\r\n果然不行啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93c494b6b2d68da3a72bd039aa3f2539da3190336fcb03b6d47b0c171a252c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dff92343fecef035e26d9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有太多美味的食物，\r\n让诗歌剧我很烦恼。\r\n得注意不能让小腹凸出来才行～",
      "source_fingerprint": "76ba57984655ff76c4d162fa8eccee9a31b6e9cafc4841f42051b4b97c716349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6deebb02504b02df68fe703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对自己的超强意志力很有自信……\r\n有自信……噫呀呀，好冷啊──！\r\n我可能要放弃啦～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcaecb2a7926d17b12d8a83f25f8a46e03a8b3f3901e3fc8305f6e5d4f1ca8be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a60d074b9a07b66bef0dddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507fc84bfb4e815ab9546f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd3dee8f70491cc4c2591b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家父母开了一家餐厅，\n味道很棒备受好评哦！\n有机会一定要来试试哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee23ff9600e1e9101c782890b005021add4d59eac317c7cf957143d20a07a3cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c6f6bbb8db8e01c9a91b04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天，想喝水的时候，\n水洒到地上了…滑倒后\n流鼻血了…呜呜，好疼～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c8456402b7702933318a710ab42f2c15e459947d320216bf48997724a6c7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d96378ddbf3499be58278a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很喜欢蜘蛛的玩偶，\n但真正的就…\n总，总有一天会习惯的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ddadfb0dc1c8a3a01287eab84b90843659aa20eed805f9dae10e7c55c592cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7624eb36853d0a38fe927912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和内恰一起走在商店街的话，\n就会被各种各样的人打招呼哦～。\n嗯呼呼，好有人气啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8e27325fbcdb6163d73824663b9e901a602058ef2ffcc863685d8a3514cd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e10eb8ca6627a51782343f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "福来前辈每天早上\n都会帮我占卜运势，\n基本上都是大吉！嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f77edc3aee2ae784f98ef56b300a24057ae308b6bbdeb78c1ae4538b38573ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b7c3fcbe5a276fc608bb4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hirahira的～\n虽然非常可爱，\n但要注意不让肚子受凉才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9c17b4d6167ec1174707aaaae6d6f331f4a9d01533d4aececa06f82cf7d1937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9bc99c4c7d5a0590dbd70c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是很适合演出的服装吧～\n大家一起站在舞台上的话，\n闪亮亮的～轻飘飘的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d5b571aded7ca654f932a9261266be878e186c08f71c01389e26edadedf0587",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5818c2e52b96bfa2bfbfa49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是！我自己的决胜服！\n也大受父母的好评哦。\n耶～，怎样样～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64370a49599c12fb3e1eff5ec68a251ce9ac7bf38045521223914512f8cfbe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3135504dd398eb7cc896b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是非～常特别的服装！\n所以要尽情地奔跑\n让大家记住我哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "298fb201238b00f0edf177d63b0438c1d4b0b7702e447583d3e80748d3b8a112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93fe96dae67aa7d22e3aff9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧体操第一部分～！\n抬起脚，嗒嗒嗒ー嗒。\n伸出手，Hohoho～hoy♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7fc756439cbebd2408debeaecccca0d0c611e2230ef77824942288348dfa2df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4f08401275c2a085f88579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要调查一下\n大家午饭都吃了什么！\n都摄取了什么营养呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e147c92d435252c89625ec663ece8a11a84d19c1521fe81091d75b5ec14eaca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b47b60fbfa82f356d23790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天深夜，飘来了\n拉面的香味…咕呜。\n不要诱惑我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1f1f3a21d1bb1a408843b2db998544572425e5e507cd6ecfae3a96162a3b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1f23670d8ed3a415fc78784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是，会让心情变得暖洋洋～\n的季节呢～。暖烘烘的…\n哈啊…暖洋洋…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dad78ab379714d618cfb22fe0cfb193d96e0d73067d9f1aeabaa3ab18bbdec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bf2852573b4caf3003519f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没籽的西瓜和有籽的西瓜，\n你喜欢哪个？我绝对是\n有籽的一方！因为摘西瓜籽很快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68a0021f778c19d65e5ebb8be6df84a25376fac2e8759c9eca0bfa0d96e56a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1933c142e3a42729db6b7162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家的定食店，秋天的秋刀鱼\n套餐很受欢迎！在萝卜泥\n上浇酱油…真不错啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d1594b815874588b93d8971f3b60ffcb647cf12e56a668a55bf8f12e152a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91426df3389a3a8651ea978e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，好冷。为了不感冒\n加油吧！准ー备，\n诶，诶…阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7efb471d306923a6313750a5c9f0e2148c8639132a8f42cf6623f4aab90f628a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d6316c0b45e2c6ae965d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "左边腰上的这个是\r\n小福前辈送我的必胜护身符！\r\n呼哪嘎～哈哪嘎～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a50ab08554f10840882d8f70e440a16e8edb65815ee3aadb11f7661f5e164e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a22755b0efcc86d1ea8560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我唯一有自信的就是意志力，\r\n但要与桂冠比耐力就……\r\n姆～有办法赢吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9783bc78fc9325aff2af0b4fbfe263a28d946ae415e043a6abbab0d15c362110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbefe244f0d2ab7e22269407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和生野旅行很棒哦！\r\n她会帮我们做超级、超级完美的\r\n「旅行手册」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a5e4ce0dbecba576522bb4a7245b6423ab8b6ab33f4e0a79ab3bf5b89415db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34bb58c118de49c1b548d9f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁对我说\r\n「你的用字遣词很不可思议呢」。\r\n……有吗？姆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af03d4b2af3e3953911ba1f0c7eea3d5ff1fe1242dca108171961dce8ef7eee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd96f7228c60bde06bc2c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我很普通，所以也会希望自己\r\n能够普通地确实响应大家的声援。\r\n耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdcea5b4ffe066b6437491cec51fbecf69f44ac8aa729bfa9af82b15a024845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef34f183494f2db961850cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我绑上一字巾，并戴上手套后，\r\n就算是一大早，也有种干劲的开关\r\n被打开的感觉呢！喝啊喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9203e2c55076f7e6dbd14b7391750f33bd83b9a9cc5131d1fec1c8f554931cfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6b48f35a9ebb90ef125dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要和素质一起吃午餐餐。\r\n……穿着这身衣服去，\r\n不晓得她会不会吓一跳呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ffcd64ec94980c896a66a9679b096aae3ed087e2a537c772e73833330390ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dc16624c250f059fc9bd1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上有一点冷呢～\r\n训练员，我可以跟你借一件\r\n披肩之类的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d74d347dfb748ffd78b1ce476cae86255080688247be4cd4e691f6eb05df2a58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c630e161814e818b90d8d247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你看我的指甲油，是不是\r\n很像蒲公英？有黄色又有黄绿色！\r\n学园外面也都开花了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "11c8bda30abd0832f975ca19d2bdd8839201c982bf1969c9b6dae670d53fc837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91024"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
